  "seo": {
    "title": "Pokémon TCG Phantasmal Flames Checklist · All 130 Cards",
    "description": "Free checklist for the Pokémon TCG Phantasmal Flames set. Track all 130 cards, or go further with every reverse holos and every special print, with images, copy counts, binder pages and prices. No sign-up needed.",
    "ogTitle": "Pokémon TCG Phantasmal Flames Checklist",
    "ogDescription": "Track all 130 cards in Pokémon TCG Phantasmal Flames: the 94-card main set and 36 secret rares, plus 84 reverse holos for a master set and 12 special prints for a grand master set. Free, no sign-up, works offline.",
